        },
        {
          "text": "Loti yunamura amaso, yitegereza ikiyaya cose co kuri Yorodani, abona ko har’ibigera vy’amazi hose. Uhoraho atararandura Sodomu na Gomora, ico kiyaya cari kimeze nka rya tongo ry’ Uhoraho, canke nk’ igihugu ca Egiputa ugiye werekeye i Sowari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Loti ahitamw’ ico kiyaya cose co kuri Yorodani; aragenda aja i burasirazuba, bahāna inta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburamu aba mu gihugu c’i Kanani, Loti aba mu bisagara vyo muri ca kiyaya, agenda arunguruza amahema arinda ashika i Sodomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
